  m_Name: PresentationArtPass_InventoryAndHooks
  m_Script: 'SandRunners Presentation Art Pass

    BASE COMMIT: a47e0c8f4d924a6788a4fb07d64731e57ab8a426


    Imported
    FBX: SR_MineConvoyTruck_LOD0/1/2, SR_MineEngineerRover_LOD0/1/2, Sebek_Running,
    Sebek_Walking.

    GLB found in Assets: none. Meshy-named assets found: none.

    Existing
    authored prefabs reused: SR_BattlePyramid_Authored, SR_GoldenScarab_Authored,
    SR_ImperialAssault_Authored, SR_MandarinkaPalace_Authored.

    AnimationClips:
    no new clips; Sebek FBX animation imports remain available.

    Audio reused:
    SR_Pyramid_Engine for Apex charge, SR_Howitzer for Apex fire, SR_AmbiencePulse
    for Apex recovery.

    Materials reused: Gold, PaleGold, DarkMetal, Gunmetal,
    CyanGlass, Ivory, Jade, Intro_Blue_Panoramic_Glass.


    New prefabs: Presentation/SR_BattlePyramid_ArtPass,
    Presentation/SR_Apex_Art, Presentation/SR_ResourceMine_Art, Presentation/SR_NeutralSettlement_Art.

    ResourceMine
    uses existing imported Mine FBX candidates; imported LOD2 is used as the source
    mesh to keep the prefab budget bounded.


    Hooks: SandRunnersAuthoredArtPass
    loads the new Resources prefabs. Pyramid art uses the existing visual hook; Apex
    attaches below the authored pyramid root; ResourceMine attaches to Resource_Sand_Refinery_01;
    NeutralSettlement attaches to Grounder_Settlement_West when those visual hosts
    exist.

    Anchors: Pyramid Muzzle/Engine/Door_Cargo/Hardpoints/Apex_Focus;
    Apex Focus/ChargeOrigin/BeamTarget; Mine Engine/Door/Hardpoints/Drills/ResourceOutput;
    Settlement Trade/Defense/Caravan/Diplomacy.


    No AI, economy, mission, bootstrap,
    Build Settings or Player build changes.'
